2026-08-16T12:01:47Z    [ADI:Adjusted gross margin] GATE critic: The “last 4 reported levels” you averaged (69.9, 71.6, 74.1, 72.2) are not the most recent quarters relevant to forecasting FY2026Q3. They are older Q3 figures (FY2020–FY2023) and even mix current and prior‑year comparators from the cited lines (e.g., 69.9% and 74.1% are shown as prior-year values). FY2024Q3 and FY2025Q3 are missing. The source snippets are duplicated across 2020/2021 and 2022/2023, indicating a copy/misattribution error. Using these wrong periods invalidates the 71.95% baseline and thus the 72.45% forecast.
