2026-08-16T12:02:13Z    [HD:Comparable sales, total company] GATE critic: The seasonal_trend input of -0.216667 used in your blend is off by an order of magnitude relative to the Q2 history you cite. From your sources, FY2023Q2 was -3.3%, FY2024Q2 was -3.3%, and FY2025Q2 was +1.0%—a simple average is about -1.87%, not -0.22%. That points to a percent/decimal-place scaling mistake in the seasonal component, which materially biases the 1.00023% result.
